{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What once was a thriving world is now lost \u2014 shattered, desolate, and forgotten.</strong><br>In <i>Dustbound</i>, you\u2019ll fight to survive in a post-apocalyptic wasteland overrun by zombies and twisted monsters. Blending strategic deckbuilding with fast-paced bullet-heaven action, <i>Dustbound</i> delivers a relentless gameplay loop that will keep you on your toes. Build powerful decks, unleash  combos, and mow down hordes of the undead and otherworldly creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/extras/Play_your_cards.png?t=1745263776\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/extras/Card_Play_With_Border.gif?t=1745263776\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/extras/Upgrade_your_cards.png?t=1745263776\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your cards to create more powerful versions with better stats and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Banish cards to gain temporary stat boosts for your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own unique upgrade pool in every round</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/extras/Timeline_1.gif?t=1745263776\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/extras/Find_lost_treasure.png?t=1745263776\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover chests filled with lost treasure and ancient artifacts hidden in the wastelands</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Choose wisely which cards and augements to add to your deck </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new cards after each run, expanding your options </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with different builds and synergies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/extras/Cropped_Chest.gif?t=1745263776\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/extras/Title_Text.png?t=1745263776\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The wasteland demands more than just a strong deck\u2014deploy your drones to the fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command up to five drones, each capable of carrying a unique weapon module</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip drones with modules for rapid-fire attacks, explosives, or crowd-control abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize each drone\u2019s stats by playing specific cards to suit your strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/extras/nEW_ESCALATION.gif?t=1745263776\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deckbuilding</strong> \u2013 Discover chests filled with new cards and augments to craft your own powerful deck. With over 100 cards, shape your upgrade pool to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Builds and Upgrades </strong>\u2013 During your turn, sacrifice two cards of the same level to upgrade them. Play cards to equip new weapons and boost your stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Horde Survival</strong> \u2013 After upgrading, dive into the action and blast your way through relentless hordes of monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sandstorms </strong>\u2013 Random sandstorms disrupt your vision and movement, adding extra chaos and challenge to the battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pack Openings and Recruiting </strong>\u2013 Use earned gold to open card packs and to recruit new explorers with unique abilities.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3442610?t=1745263776","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745263776","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/c753fe46835c03f233e60623eec22d3eb8f91df0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745263776","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/c753fe46835c03f233e60623eec22d3eb8f91df0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745263776","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What once was a thriving world is now lost \u2014 shattered, desolate, and forgotten.</strong><br>In <i>Dustbound</i>, you\u2019ll fight to survive in a post-apocalyptic wasteland overrun by zombies and twisted monsters. Blending strategic deckbuilding with fast-paced bullet-heaven action, <i>Dustbound</i> delivers a relentless gameplay loop that will keep you on your toes. Build powerful decks, unleash  combos, and mow down hordes of the undead and otherworldly creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/extras/Play_your_cards.png?t=1745263776\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/extras/Card_Play_With_Border.gif?t=1745263776\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/extras/Upgrade_your_cards.png?t=1745263776\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your cards to create more powerful versions with better stats and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Banish cards to gain temporary stat boosts for your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own unique upgrade pool in every round</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/extras/Timeline_1.gif?t=1745263776\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/extras/Find_lost_treasure.png?t=1745263776\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover chests filled with lost treasure and ancient artifacts hidden in the wastelands</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Choose wisely which cards and augements to add to your deck </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new cards after each run, expanding your options </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with different builds and synergies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/extras/Cropped_Chest.gif?t=1745263776\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/extras/Title_Text.png?t=1745263776\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The wasteland demands more than just a strong deck\u2014deploy your drones to the fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command up to five drones, each capable of carrying a unique weapon module</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip drones with modules for rapid-fire attacks, explosives, or crowd-control abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize each drone\u2019s stats by playing specific cards to suit your strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/extras/nEW_ESCALATION.gif?t=1745263776\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deckbuilding</strong> \u2013 Discover chests filled with new cards and augments to craft your own powerful deck. With over 100 cards, shape your upgrade pool to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Builds and Upgrades </strong>\u2013 During your turn, sacrifice two cards of the same level to upgrade them. Play cards to equip new weapons and boost your stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Horde Survival</strong> \u2013 After upgrading, dive into the action and blast your way through relentless hordes of monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sandstorms </strong>\u2013 Random sandstorms disrupt your vision and movement, adding extra chaos and challenge to the battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pack Openings and Recruiting </strong>\u2013 Use earned gold to open card packs and to recruit new explorers with unique abilities.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Nordman"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3441420","name":"Dustbound"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442610/header.jpg?t=1745263776","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125988,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125988/movie480.mp4?t=1744661372","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125988/movie_max.mp4?t=17446